  "title": "Key West Pink Shrimp and Florida Spiny Lobster Tails served with Hot Key Lime Butter",
  "description": "A recipe from sunny Florida combines shrimp with spiny lobster meat and mushrooms in a piquant butter and Key lime sauce. Serve with hot cooked pasta or rice.",
